WelcomeLabel1=Install extynt AI tools
WelcomeLabel2=This installs extynt AI tools for every user on this PC. The first one is for After Effects: describe a change, get a plan, apply it in one click, undo it if you change your mind. More tools are coming.%n%nEach user runs this installer once from their own account to set up the panel. No prompt engineering required.%n%nQuit After Effects first.%n%nAfter Effects 2025 or later. Adobe and After Effects are either registered trademarks or trademarks of Adobe Inc. in the United States and/or other countries. extynt is an independent product and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Adobe Inc.
